# recorded as a SHA-256 in its NOTICE.md. Line-ending translation would change
# those bytes on disk without changing the blob, so the recorded hash would fail
# to verify on any checkout that normalises — which is the default on Windows.
# Keep it byte-exact so the provenance record stays checkable.
crates/dpp-tests/fixtures/aas/aas.json -text
